      <tei:div type="colophon" subtype="notes">
        <tei:p>A paraliturgical English translation of a Ḳaddish by Rabbi Daniel Brenner. The wording of the ḳaddish itself is neither a half-ḳaddish and a bit shorter than the mourner’s ḳaddish. Text of the ḳaddish in Aramaic amended to Rabbi Brenner’s interpretation. –Aharon Varady</tei:p>
